.sp
\fBAuthor\fP: Pahaz \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pahaz>
.sp
\fBRepo\fP: \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pahaz/\:sshtunnel>
.sp
Inspired by \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:jmagnusson/\:bgtunnel>, which doesn\(aqt work on
