.B v.0.3.0 (Pahaz \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pahaz>)
.INDENT 7.0
.IP \(bu 2
Change default with context behavior to use \fI\&.stop(force=True)\fP on exit (is not fully backward compatible)
.IP \(bu 2
Remove useless \fIdaemon_forward_servers = True\fP hack for hangs prevention (is not fully backward compatible)
.IP \(bu 2
Set transport keepalive to 5 second by default (disabled for version < 0.3.0)
.IP \(bu 2
Set default transport timeout to 0.1
.IP \(bu 2
Deprecate and remove \fIblock_on_close\fP option
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \(dqdeadlocks\(dq / \(dqtunneling hangs\(dq (#173 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pahaz/\:sshtunnel/\:issues/\:173>, #201 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pahaz/\:sshtunnel/\:issues/\:201>, #162 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pahaz/\:sshtunnel/\:issues/\:162>, #211 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pahaz/\:sshtunnel/\:issues/\:211>)
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
.INDENT 2.0
